# Generated protobuf code (regenerate from proto/, don't commit)
/sdk/*/generated/

# Groth16 keys generated by zk-poc/src/bin/generate_keys.rs. The two
# small ones (banking-basel-iii, healthcare-hipaa) are deliberately
# checked in under zk-poc/keys/ -- see that directory's own README for
# why, and for the load-bearing caveat about what "checked in" does NOT
# mean (these ignore rules exist so the LARGE ones -- banking-basel-iii-
# bound's ~16.4 MiB and gov-supply-chain-integrity's ~64 MiB, per
# BENCHMARKS.md -- can never be accidentally `git add`ed if generated
# into a tracked directory by mistake; already-tracked files under
# zk-poc/keys/ are unaffected by adding this rule).
*.pk
*.vk
!/zk-poc/keys/*.pk
!/zk-poc/keys/*.vk
